{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：19:13 2026-09-28 HKT</p>\n\n<p>葵涌有少女墮樓亡。今日（28日）下午5時許，警方接獲一名女子報案，指其15歲妹妹於安蔭邨豐蔭樓的寓所一躍而下，倒卧平台，昏迷不醒。救援人員接報到場，經檢查後證實少女當場不治，警方正調查少女墮樓原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"現場為安蔭邨豐蔭樓。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31bdb94df6c537056c7446a1834d8bac/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_18_57_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方正調查少女墮樓原因。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1cb6fe9d8ad1187886f67a7ba9f1179a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_18_57_46_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"少女從高處墮下，當場不治。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1cdf73a8f45c530ca808df43e578116/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_18_57_44_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方正調查少女墮樓原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6fadd50a8dda7ce8fc1c77f1610674e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_18_57_44_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為安蔭邨豐蔭樓。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b41958c2109a14a3702e4fccad32867/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-28_at_19_07_52.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T11:19:21.133344+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}